{"ticker":"DAL","updated":"2026-10-23T22:50:44Z","profile":{"longName":"Delta Air Lines, Inc.","shortName":"Delta Air Lines, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Airlines","country":"United States","website":"https://www.delta.com","fullTimeEmployees":100000,"marketCap":50514513920,"trailingPE":15.325348,"forwardPE":10.5201,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.7035448,"pegRatio":0.21,"targetMeanPrice":100.775,"targetHighPrice":125.0,"targetLowPrice":53.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.211,"earningsGrowth":-0.47,"grossMargins":0.17896,"operatingMargins":0.07218,"profitMargins":0.04581,"totalRevenue":71799996416,"beta":1.336,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":95.68,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":55.03,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.09},"summary":"Delta Air Lines, Inc. provides scheduled air transportation for passengers and cargo in the United States and internationally. The company operates through two segments, Airline and Refinery. Its domestic network centered on core hubs in Atlanta, Detroit, Minneapolis-St. Paul, and Salt Lake City, as well as coastal hub positions in Boston, Los Angeles, New York-LaGuardia, New York-JFK, and Seattle; and international network centered on hubs and market presence in Amsterdam, Bogota, Lima, Mexico City, London-Heathrow, Paris-Charles de Gaulle, Santiago (Chile), Sao Paulo, Seoul-Incheon, and Tokyo. It also provides aircraft maintenance and engineering support, repair, and overhaul services; and vacation packages. The company operates through a fleet of approximately 1,314 aircraft. Delta Air Lines, Inc. was founded in 1924 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","summary_zh":"達美航空 (Delta Air Lines, Inc.) 為美國和國際上的乘客和貨物提供定期航空運輸。該公司透過兩個部門運作：航空公司部門和煉油廠部門。其國內網路以亞特蘭大、底特律、明尼亞波利斯-聖路易斯等核心樞紐為中心。聖保羅和鹽湖城，以及波士頓、洛杉磯、紐約-拉瓜迪亞、紐約-甘迺迪和西雅圖的沿海樞紐位置；以及以阿姆斯特丹、波哥大、利馬、墨西哥城、倫敦希思羅機場、巴黎戴高樂機場、聖地牙哥（智利）、聖保羅、首爾仁川和東京等樞紐和市場為中心的國際網路。它還提供飛機維護和工程支援、修理和大修服務；和度假套餐。該公司擁有約 1,314 架飛機的機隊。達美航空成立於 1924 年，總部位於